      "text": "# LL sub-band LSBs carry the message (integer Haar DWT)\nrows = [r.split() for r in open(\"ll_subband.txt\") if r.strip()]\nbits = [int(v) & 1 for row in rows for v in row]\nout = bytearray()\nfor i in range(0, len(bits)//8*8, 8):\n    v = 0\n    for b in bits[i:i+8]:\n        v = (v << 1) | b\n    out.append(v)\ns = out.decode(\"latin-1\")\nj = s.find(\"nto{\")\nprint(s[j:j+40].split(\"\\x00\")[0])\n"
